  <item>
    <title>Ep.20 泰好笑：两穷猪爆逛泰兰德！（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5cdf1c6356eb2d9be50b19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5cdf1c6356eb2d9be50b19</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 14:33:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>紧接上集！本期是</span><strong><span>泰好笑</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>下篇</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> </span><strong><span>Day5 清迈-曼谷</span></strong><br><span>        </span><strong><span>战略化</span></strong><span>大逛</span><strong><span>JJ market</span></strong><span>：穷鬼也没招，大买特买</span><br><span>        王姐开启狂喝</span><strong><span>康普茶</span></strong><span>之旅</span><br><span>        </span><strong><span>大巴站式</span></strong><span>的飞机场与</span><strong><span>过山车式</span></strong><span>的飞行旅程</span><br><span>        富人超市大打折：王姐美美吃上黑刺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> </span><strong><span>Day6 曼谷</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>        </span><strong><span>火焰山</span></strong><span>般的市场：义乌小商品市场+广州白云城+莆田鞋都+华强北</span><br><span>        银饰店的</span><strong><span>人型监控</span></strong><span>：原始防盗方法</span><br><span>        </span><strong><span>又踩雷</span></strong><span>的米其林店：甜的要命+怪的吓人</span><br><span>        Central World </span><strong><span>逛到昏厥</span></strong><span>：怎么会有这么大的商场！</span><br><span>        再入富人超市购入打折商品，却享尊贵服务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> </span><strong><span>Day7 曼谷</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>        </span><strong><span>冠军咖啡Factory</span></strong><span>：不必特意排队</span><br><span>        </span><strong><span>Galile Oasis</span></strong><span>：美妙到不行！谁再说避雷呢！</span><br><span>       ！！！！！！</span><strong><span> 经济危机到来</span></strong><span>！！！！！！</span><br><span>       松松海鲜店：好吃、且变为</span><strong><span>换汇圣地</span></strong><br><span>       学习美女拍照大失败：直接锁屏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> </span><strong><span>Day8 曼谷</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>        Friend &amp; Friend：又是</span><strong><span>美美出片</span></strong><br><span>        永远在看行李箱和拖鞋的旅程</span><br><span>        一个半小时的</span><strong><span>马杀鸡</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>被踹</span></strong><span>的重获</span><strong><span>新生</span></strong><br><strong><span>    </span></strong><span>    仑披尼公园：曼谷的玄武湖公园（十分之一版）</span><br><span>        再回Central World：依旧没买到拖鞋！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3285">54:45</a> </span><strong><span>八天两万哥</span></strong><span>：完全是</span><strong><span>度假</span></strong><span>式旅游</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
