  <item>
    <title>Ep.19 泰好笑：两穷猪爆逛泰兰德！（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5cc7c76356eb2d9be4ff4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5cc7c76356eb2d9be4ff4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 12:58:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>断更许久，</span></strong><span>我们终于回归，拖更积压的一堆破事</span><strong><span>留到下下期节目细说</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>李的壮和王姐</span></strong><span>直冲泰国疯玩一趟，行程搞笑到一集装不下，拆成上下两期放送，本期先听</span><strong><span>泰好笑</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>上篇</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 下下期节目精彩</span><strong><span>预告</span></strong><span>：螺丝张（没）</span><strong><span>喜做小3</span></strong><span>，请各位</span><strong><span>燥候</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> </span><strong><span>出行前</span></strong><span>最大的准备：买梯子上Google Map大存特存</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> </span><strong><span>Day 1 昆明转机</span></strong><span>：酷儿姐妹菌子</span><strong><span>破费</span></strong><span>大招待</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> </span><strong><span>Day2 清迈</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>菜单是天书</span></strong><span>的米其林垃圾：大踩雷！</span><br><span>                         丛林飞跃：夯！两老货沉默对话痨三人组</span><br><span>                         伴随泰国游一生的主题：</span><strong><span>买拖鞋</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> </span><strong><span>Day3 清迈</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>两老猪进食</span></strong><span>：Crew Hotel的自助早饭夯的不行！</span><br><span>                         粘粘瀑布：夯到</span><strong><span>内裤湿透</span></strong><span>，还要死等没素质团友</span><br><span>                         Kitchen Yum：</span><strong><span>通讯录熊</span></strong><span>做生腌虾，干净又美味！</span><br><span>                         强推</span><strong><span>泰式按摩</span></strong><span>：穷货最爱</span><br><span>                         无数夯店逛到关门：两大爱牌——</span><strong><span>“农民”、“humble pie”</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> </span><strong><span>Day4 清迈</span></strong><span>：妈妈厨房的英文班：</span><strong><span>人种过于丰富</span></strong><br><span>                         无出片姐、老家人说英语、HK男也是男同、语言天才老师、经典白男</span><br><span>                         美妙</span><strong><span>乌蒙寺</span></strong><span>：满是青苔与纯象牙纪念品</span><br><span>                         找寻一路的奶茶店：花钱只为💩</span><br><span>                         艺术村市集：购入貌美帆布包</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c4a848db5e6d6bf9b869fe/lmS9Dd_vhLKF90g8dMnn7I2Y87m8.m4a" length="56609504" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:20</itunes:duration>
