  <item>
    <title>Ep.18 年终盘点之搞成的、搞砸的，以及我们还想继续走下去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695464282db086f897e8eb6c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695464282db086f897e8eb6c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这一期播客里，我们通过年度复盘，和彼此一起把 </span><strong><span>2025 年完整地走了一遍</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有宏大叙事，也没有标准答案。</span><br><span>有的是：做成的事、没做成的事，反复怀疑自己的时刻，短暂但真实的幸福瞬间，以及在情绪最低点时，如何硬着头皮往前走。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也正站在新旧一年交界处，感到疲惫、迷茫，或者只是想听两个普通人诚实地复盘一年——希望这一期能陪你坐一会儿。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> – 给 2025 年的几个关键词</span></strong><br><span>从“期待”到“保守乐观”，我们各自对 2025 的核心关键词是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> – 今年真正“搞成”的几件事</span></strong><br><span>哪些事情回头看，才发现自己其实走得比想象中远？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a> – 那些搞砸了、失败了、至今仍有点不甘心的瞬间</span></strong><br><span>失败是结果，还是过程的一部分？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> – 2025 年的幸福时刻</span></strong><br><span>很小，但很确定：那些让人愿意继续生活下去的瞬间。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> – 崩溃过几次？我们是怎么熬过来的</span></strong><br><span>情绪最低点的时候，我们各自抓住了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3261">54:21</a> – 对 2026 年的“非宏愿式”期待</span></strong><br><span>不立 flag，只说一点点真心希望发生的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟着感觉走-张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果每天都可以 happy happy 谁想要sad:)) - 一起去度假-陈娴静</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c4a848db5e6d6bf9b869fe/lmWB5yAC6Foe5vD7OyunsyjnpHs2.m4a" length="61077212" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsU89wiHebO6TRwU5_T4wfjox4JJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.17 朱迪和尼克其实是直女和通讯录的组合，谁支持谁反对？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6932f00b4ef12f9fe91f8682</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6932f00b4ef12f9fe91f8682</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 14:53:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>什么都别说了，我们</span><strong><span>没落贵族</span></strong><span>看什么都</span><strong><span>看不出爱情了</span></strong><span>。看了</span><strong><span>《疯狂动物城1/2》</span></strong><span>的友友们来辩一辩：朱迪和尼克到底是不是在谈恋爱？到底是</span><strong><span>直女直男</span></strong><span>还是</span><strong><span>两个通讯录</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 支持理由1:不同动物存在物种隔离，生不出小孩&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 支持理由2:人物形象太可爱，小孩不能早恋&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 乱点鸳鸯谱：朱迪和牛局长=楚雨寻和慕容云海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 支持理由3:没有确立过情侣关系的也可以love u &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 支持理由4:尼克高于普通直男的精神境界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 和豆瓣网友们的评论一致意见&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 关系的合理解释：带有唯一性的友谊&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c4a848db5e6d6bf9b869fe/ls5UMDLbCPQFunaIf2ybp4YV2UHd.m4a" length="37443560" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsU89wiHebO6TRwU5_T4wfjox4JJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.16 军训爱上教官，工作爱上同事的到底是什么人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69002d8601567203215c3de3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69002d8601567203215c3de3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 02:57:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>是我，不好意思，是赔钱货李的壮。当年有多嘲讽这类人群，现在就有多打脸。再再次迎来《恋爱大师课》系列的第三期，这是一期案例分析课，提前剧透：be结局，过程搞笑曲折。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 螺丝张官宣啦！！！！见娘家人了！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 李的壮的澄清：没爱上教官，也不好说是爱上同事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 宫里不能对食，现在对一下看看呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a> 被搞笑女同事一上来就质问性取向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 和新疆男的力量之战：谁能搬动行军床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 大馋丫头的好福气：夜宵偶遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 独来独往、准时准点的习惯为他而变：因为是单眼皮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 百年难遇的巧合：突遇故人卡姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 炎热七夕夏夜，玄武湖红军长征&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 恋爱大师们对直男的猜测也难得是全错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> 过于纯净的抖音页面：不沾女色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a> 周末出不了门是什么毛病？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 螺丝张忍不住锐评：一锅屎里有一粒米</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">48:22</a> 已读不回造就的be结局：人没出事吧？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3497">58:17</a> 直男难以理解的拍照姿势：比1、4、3……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c4a848db5e6d6bf9b869fe/lue_3Eov9NLOHaeh1PXPBBl0oNlC.m4a" length="93777788" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsU89wiHebO6TRwU5_T4wfjox4JJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.15 麻辣熊兵与梯形丑男的押金之战</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e293368e321a0d6f053d91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e293368e321a0d6f053d91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Oct 2025 15:58:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没落贵族在这里祝愿大家</span><strong><span>国庆中秋双节快乐</span></strong><span>啦！！！螺丝张立刻献上超绝</span><strong><span>慕尼黑军旅故事</span></strong><span>来为大家助兴，身为</span><strong><span>麻辣熊兵</span></strong><span>的他以一己之力、</span><strong><span>战狼之魂</span></strong><span>大战</span><strong><span>拖欠房租押金的丑男</span></strong><span>，成为Ep.03的精彩续集。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> 爱听我们播客的陌生听众真的是高品位人群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 有些人天生就蠢，反而过得幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 心大的傻丫头直接给上八千米押金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> 穷到昏了头：家里有破碎的妈，还是难缠的弟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 要债的过两天就是真的过两天，不然呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 麻辣熊兵绝不退步，直接出征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 女王简短发言：退押金！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 梯形丑男就是想把钱捂在手里纯恶心人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 如果报警了就太好了！又有新播客素材了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 麻辣熊兵的终极武器：偷藏臭屁虫攻击&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 期待麻辣熊兵的举报结果 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
