    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年的最后一期【</span><strong><span>没落贵族</span></strong><span>】来临！！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢大家半年来的收听与陪伴！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目梳理了从一月到十二月的</span><strong><span>流水账</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 一月：李的壮东百行，螺丝张家里蹲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 二月：没落贵族全体爬山团建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 三月：李的壮环太湖，螺丝张艳遇贵州猴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 四月：李的壮返苏聚餐，螺丝张长沙吃小嘴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 五月：李的壮再次返苏，螺丝张装假牙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 六月：李的壮游长沙，螺丝张杭州行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 七月：李的壮蹲监狱，螺丝张贵州蜜月游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 八月、九月、十月：没落贵族们的共同阴暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 十一月：李的壮又又又去苏州加敦煌出差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 与自己和解的一年：慕尼黑U熊与孤独的人生常态 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>真心希望2025年还有更多的作品陪伴大家</span></strong><strong><span>！！！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
